{
  "bodyHash": "ZwT1lQuTE/A=",
  "content": "<p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveAircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Github\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"通过 Crowdin 翻译\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=crowdin&amp;color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p><p>\n这个模组添加了一系列质朴的飞行器，用于旅行、运输和探索！\n这些飞行器非常注重保持原版风格，拥有许多细节和功能，同时不会过于复杂。\n</p><p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/atlas?minecraft_version=1.20.1&amp;locations=_immersive_aircraft:aircraft&amp;dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveAircraft/tree/1.20.1?&amp;c=1&amp;resolution=48&amp;background=fancy&amp;row_size=10\" alt=\"生成的图集图片\"></p><p>哦对了，支持多人游戏！</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/screen1.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p><h1>双翼机</h1><p>让我们从经典的双翼机开始。速度快，单人座，难度中等。</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/biplane.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p><h1>飞艇</h1><p>速度较慢，但有两个座位。操作相当简单，由于后部引擎，速度还算可以接受。还有更大体积的货运型号！</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/airship.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p><h1>旋翼机</h1><p>人力驱动的原始双座飞行器。可靠，但既不是最快也不是最容易飞的。需要良好的初始推力来让旋翼旋转起来。</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/gyrodyne.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p><h1>四轴飞行器</h1><p>工程学的杰作！四个螺旋桨绑在一堆竹子上。对于建造来说非常方便。</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/quadrocopter.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p><h1>战船</h1><p>\n铜与钢的巨兽，为征服天空而生！\n四个座位，可旋转炮塔，6个武器挂点，体积大到超出了Minecraft物理的承受范围。\n</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/warship.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p><h1>一些可供改造的物品</h1><p>由于飞行器通常比船等更复杂，因此添加了一些物品，使得制作飞行器感觉更像是实际组装东西。</p><p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/recipes?minecraft_version=1.20.1&amp;locations=immersive_aircraft:.*&amp;dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveAircraft/tree/1.20.1?&amp;c=1&amp;resolution=16&amp;animated=False&amp;row_width=835\" alt=\"生成的合成配方图片\"></p><h1>物品栏</h1><p>升级槽、燃料、旗帜、染料、火箭助推器和存储空间。给你的飞行器一个个性化的外观！</p><p><img width=\"550\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=550,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/inventory.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p><h1>众多升级</h1><p>按你的喜好升级和调校你的飞行器！</p><p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/atlas?minecraft_version=1.20.1&amp;locations=_immersive_aircraft:upgrades&amp;dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveAircraft/tree/1.20.1?&amp;c=1&amp;resolution=48&amp;background=fancy&amp;row_size=10\" alt=\"生成的图集图片\"></p><p>在你的飞行器上安装各种武器和实用设备！</p><p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/atlas?minecraft_version=1.20.1&amp;locations=_immersive_aircraft:weapons&amp;dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveAircraft/tree/1.20.1?&amp;c=1&amp;resolution=48&amp;background=fancy&amp;row_size=10\" alt=\"生成的图集图片\"></p><h1>视频</h1><span><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-XOlaZHOu4I?wmode=transparent\" height=\"480\" width=\"836\"></iframe></span></span><h1>扩展包</h1><p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/man-of-many-planes\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Man of Many Planes&amp;description=为沉浸式飞行器添加一系列额外飞行器，并考虑到与Create模组的兼容性。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Man of Many Planes\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-machinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Machinery&amp;description=一系列用于运输、采矿和自动化的质朴机械。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Machinery\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aviator-dreams\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Aviator Dreams&amp;description=从小型到大型的真实飞机。&amp;icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1100/961/64/64/638648594348458560.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Aviator Dreams\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ia-remaining-airborne\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Remaining Airborne&amp;description=一组经典战斗机。&amp;icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1168/829/64/64/638739800864929977.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Remaining Airborne\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/warfare-wings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Warfare Wings&amp;description=添加了许多不同涂装方案的二战战斗机。&amp;icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1225/83/64/64/638802892619093611.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Warfare Wings\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fia_engines\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Better Engines&amp;description=添加了许多新的升级，主要是引擎，还有涡轮增压器和机械增压器。&amp;icon_url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/legoaggelos/ia_engines/refs/heads/main/common/src/main/resources/assets/more_engines/textures/item/supercharger.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Better Engines\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/civilian-aviation\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Civilian Aviation&amp;description=包含来自各个时代的风格化真实飞机和直升机！&amp;icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1808/958/256/256/639144393942056440.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Civilian Aviation\">\n</a></p><h1>资源包</h1><p>不喜欢我的风格和/或想要更好的Create模组兼容性？看看下面这些超棒的资源包！</p><p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/more-immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=More Immersive Aircraft&amp;description=为沉浸式飞行器提供原版风格且更真实的纹理。&amp;icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1180/610/64/64/638753853503436917.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"More Immersive Aircraft\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-immersive-aircrafts-resource-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Create Immersive Aircraft&amp;description=Create风格的沉浸式飞行器资源包和数据包。&amp;icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/849/496/64/64/638250478085753003.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Create Immersive Aircraft\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-style-modded-compats\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Create Style Compats&amp;description=Create风格的物品纹理。&amp;icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/485/413/64/64/637785634308178232.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Create Style Compats\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/faithful-32x-immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Faithful - Immersive Aircrafts&amp;description=沉浸式飞行器的FAITHFUL 32x资源包。&amp;icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/798/431/64/64/638160303843226902.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Faithful - Immersive Aircrafts\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-immersive-aircraft-warship\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Create IA: Warship&amp;description=战船的Create风格纹理。&amp;icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1004/277/64/64/638525212330806757.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Create IA: Warship\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-immersive-aircrafts-andesite-chests-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Create Andesite Chests&amp;description=所有飞行器的Create风格安山岩箱子。&amp;icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1010/406/64/64/638534030337746940.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Create Andesite Chests\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/danceboys-biplane-to-xwing\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Danceboys X-wing&amp;description=将双翼机替换为X翼战机！&amp;icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1327/379/64/64/638862867702387346.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Danceboys X-wing\">\n</a></p><h1>沉浸式系列</h1><p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Armors&amp;description=大量独特且保持原版风格的盔甲套装。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Armors\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Aircraft&amp;description=一系列用于旅行、运输和探索的质朴飞行器！&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Aircraft\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-melodies\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Melodies&amp;description=在各种乐器上演奏自定义旋律，去烦你的朋友们！&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Melodies\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Paintings&amp;description=拖放、像素化并挂起美丽的艺术品。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Paintings\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-optimization\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Optimization&amp;description=一个轻量级的实体刻调度器，可使你的TPS翻倍。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Optimization\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selectivebounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=SelectiveBounds&amp;description=在不相关时隐藏难看的方块选择轮廓。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"SelectiveBounds\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-furniture\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Furniture&amp;description=在游戏中创建自定义的精致家具，或从庞大的在线库中选择。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Furniture\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-gateways\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Gateways&amp;description=散布在主世界中的神秘、被遗忘已久的传送门。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Gateways\">\n</a></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=172ed73c9c7b23b143085297e790a860\" alt=\"用于简化页面部署的页面哈希。\"></p>",
